# The Sound of Silence (Harmonica)

A simple numeric harmonica arrangement of *The Sound of Silence* by Paul Simon.
Diatonic C

Positive numbers are blow notes.
Negative numbers are draw notes.

```
-4 -4 -5 -5 -6 -6  6
 4  4  4  5  5  6  6 -5

-5 -5 -6 -6  7  7 -8 -8  7

-5 -5 -6 -6  7  7 -8 -8  7

-5 -5 -8 -8 -8  8 -9 -9  8 -8  7
-8  7 -6

-5 -5 -5  7 
 5 -5 -4
```

